  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Since $\\left(x+\\sqrt{x^2-1}\\right)^8+\\left(x-\\sqrt{x^2-1}\\right)^8$\n$\\begin{array}{r}=2\\left\\{{ }^8 C_0 x^8+{ }^8 C_2 x^6\\left(x^2-1\\right)+{ }^8 C_4 x^4\\left(x^2-1\\right)^2\\right. \\\\ \\left.+{ }^8 C_6 x^2\\left(x^2-1\\right)^3+{ }^8 C_8 x^0\\left(x^2-1\\right)^4\\right\\}\\end{array}$\nSo coefficient of highest power of $x$\n$=2\\left\\{{ }^8 C_0+{ }^8 C_2+{ }^8 C_4+{ }^8 C_6+{ }^8 C_8\\right\\}$\n$=(1+1)^8+(1-1)^8=2^8=256$",
    "image": null
  },
